# Project Rules

## Stack

* Next.js App Router
* TypeScript
* Tailwind CSS
* shadcn/ui
* React hooks only

## UI

* Industrial clean B2B design
* White background
* Blue accent colors
* Minimal modern UI
* Large spacing
* Rounded cards
* Responsive design mobile-first

## Components

* Create reusable components
* Use composition pattern
* Keep components small
* Separate UI and business logic
* Use modular scss files for example app.module.scss
* For each .tsx file create a matching .test.tsx file and write tests for it. Always run tests before build
* For each file .tsx you do .test.tsx and write a test for that fall there. Always run tests before build

## Styling

* Use Tailwind only
* Avoid inline styles
* Use cn() utility for class merging

## Code Style

* Functional components only
* Use TypeScript strictly
* Avoid any
* Prefer const over function
* Use async/await

## Folder Structure

* app/
* components/
* config/
* context/
* env/
* hooks/
* layouts/
* lib/
* providers/
* services/
* styles/
* types/

## Forms

* react-hook-form
* yup validation

## API

* axios
* server actions when possible
* @tanstack/react-query

## Animations

* Framer Motion minimal animations only

## Important

* Write production-ready code
* Prefer clean architecture
* Avoid overengineering
* Components must be adaptive
